    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bite Size Terrors: </h2><strong>Are Short Experimental Horror Experiences each with their own Unique Genres and Styles.</strong><br><strong>From the Creator of Notebook Entries, this is...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reverse Blue:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An Atmospheric Mystery.<br></li><li>Use your Pod to fly around &amp; Investigate the events surrounding your fellow Air Mates.<br></li><li>Fear Open Space, the only thing between you &amp; the ground, is a Bright Blue Sky.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2>As an engineer, your objective is to make sure your fellow air companions are doing okay mentally &amp; that their Ethers are operational. <br>Ethers are used to survey Weather Disturbances &amp; Conduct Research.<br>Today, as you float across the sky, an Ether is unusually floating below the clouds.<br>HQ encourages you to investigate the matter, as you do, you slowly realize,<br>This Bright Blue Sky... Is Hiding Something.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Control a Pod in an open blue sky. Clouds cover your view at a distance, while you try to find each Ether to uncover the truth. <br>Look through logs, investigate each Ether &amp; the outside air around you.",
